# .dto-audit-suppress — Suppressed DTO hydration audit warnings.
#
# Format:
#   procedure:column            — suppress a column mismatch for that procedure
#   procedure:dto:column        — suppress an inline gap field (procedure→DTO→field)
#   # comment                   — ignored
#   blank lines                 — ignored
#
# Each entry must be verified safe before adding.  Include a comment explaining
# WHY the gap is acceptable (e.g. "callers only use id/name").
#
# To check for new gaps: python3 scripts/audit-dto-hydration.py --ci
# To see all mismatches: python3 scripts/audit-dto-hydration.py --verbose

